<title>JAPAN: Tomato Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tomato Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    13.12		vs	   15.88</p>
<p> Operating	    1.99		vs	    1.75</p>
<p> Current	    313 million	 vs	  682 million</p>
<p> Net		  421 million	 vs	  460 million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.09 yen	  vs	    6.64 yen</p>
<p> Shares		69 million	 vs	   69 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tomato Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in Okayama.</p>
</text>
